window.products.push({"id":558176,"name":"Thermos 17 Ounce Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Hydration Bottle, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HGHspsNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleek style and functionality unite in the Sipp by Thermos vacuumware line of products. The hydration bottle features the patented Thermos vacuum insulation technology. This provides maximum temperature retention and will keep liquids cold for up to 12 hours. With an Durable stainless steel interior and exterior, this bottle is entirely BPA free. The compact design is lightweight for easy portability and the lid features hygienic push button operation and a pop-up straw. Dishwasher safe, 17-ounce capacity. To operate the push button sipper lid on the hydration bottle: Rotate the stainless steel locking ring down. Rotate the stainless steel locking ring down. Push the button on the sipper lid to open the top. Drink or pour beverage. Push the button on the sipper lid to open the top. Drink or pour beverage. To close, push the top down until it snaps in place. To close, push the top down until it snaps in place. To secure the top, rotate the stainless steel locking ring up until it snaps in place. To secure the top, rotate the stainless steel locking ring up until it snaps in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HGHspsNyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B003PGRU6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003PGRU6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003PGRU6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
