window.products.push({"id":558212,"name":"Remco 69823 Seamless Hygienic Shovel - BPA-Free, Food-Safe, Commercial Grade Kitchen and Gardening Accessories, 14\", Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517PoOyDHuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*** From snow removal to food processing, our hygienic shovel has you covered! ***Remco one-piece polypropylene shovels are tough, lightweight and hygienic, and are great for moving bulk materials. An integral part of any professional cross–contamination containment, food safety or HACCP program, our shovels are hygienically designed and made from FDA-compliant materials. The unique seamless design eliminates cracks or crevices to help prevent bacterial growth in canisters or bins, and the heavy-duty, food-safe, BPA-free, chemical-resistant polypropylene plastic material will not rust or corrode. Our hygienic scoopers and shovels are designed to stand up to both freezing cold and scorching hot temperatures, which means that they won’t melt, bend, or shatter, even when faced with extreme temperatures ranging from -22F to 176F. This model is practical, portable, and multipurpose, and can be used to scoop snow, ice, animal feed, grain, fertilizer, manure, garden soil, gravel, rocks, coal, sod, compost, rock salt, and more.*** Your partners in hygiene! ***At Remco, you’ll find people who truly care about food safety and sanitation. We believe that safe food starts with the right tools and utensils. Remco provides specialized solutions and products including color-coded tools for cleaning and material handling where hygiene and safety are critical. As part of the Vikan family of companies, Remco is an international leader in manufacturing sanitation and food contact tools. Our combined expertise in food safety allows us to provide comprehensive solutions to food processors. We also offer other industrial grade products the commercial food industry relies on, such as brooms, brushes, dustpans, handles, scrapers, and squeegees.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517PoOyDHuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Remco","source_asin":"B0BYMD4NMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYMD4NMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYMD4NMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
