window.products.push({"id":558256,"name":"Birthday Gifts to Women Sister: Scented Candle Gift for Friend, Aromatherapy Candles for Home Scented Long Burning, Large Jar Soy Natural Vanilla Arom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sD3vIX0DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE SISTER GIFTS FOR SISTER: This meaningful gift to show your love and best wish for your sister, printed with words that represent your heart. Your bestie will miss you when she lights this scented candle, it's a unique present for any sister who loves aromatherapy candles. Perfect for your soul sister, big sister, little sister, unbiological sister, twin sister, step sister, cousin, sister in law, long-distance sister, best friend, bestie, and BFF. VANILLA AROMA: Infused with refreshing notes of natural Vanilla, long-lasting strong fragrance. Our vanilla candles can help you relax, soothe, restore & balance your body and mind. Calm the nerves and relieve anxiety, making them the best stress-relieving candles. It can be used for insomnia, meditation, aromatherapy, removing odors, etc. LONG LASTING FRAGRANCE: Our scented candle has 9 ounces, one candle can burn approximately 60-70 hours. Long burning time, long-lasting pleasant fragrance, help you relax and relieve fatigue.The candle is great for sleep-promoting and relief from anxiety, depression, and stress. A perfect addition to the bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, living room, office, etc. NON TOXIC: Our jar candles are made from all natural soy wax, phthalate-free, & cruelty-free, and finished with 100% cotton wicks. Uniform and clean-burning, long lasting burning for more than 50 hours. Whether your goal is to celebrate a special occasion, create a romantic ambiance, or host a pleasant conversation among friends, our comfortable soy candle fragrances will not disappoint. PERFECT FOR MANY OCCASIONS: Celebrate for special days, like on sister's 18th, 20th, 30th, 40th, 50th, or 60th birthday. Also Mother's day, anniversary, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, Christmas Day, stocking stuffers, wedding, retirements, engagement, graduation, going away, house warming, holidays, bridal shower, or just girls' weekend, this candle gift for women is an perfect ideal gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sD3vIX0DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEARLGMBH","source_asin":"B0BLJXHVZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLJXHVZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLJXHVZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558257,"name":"Denmark 8-Inch Open Fry Pan, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vouyHGmzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 8-inch light enamel open fry pan is cast from fine grain black iron then hand ground until it is significantly lighter than traditional cast iron cookware—with all of its benefits unaffected. Finally, it is fired with a heavy porcelain enamel exterior coating for added durability. The handle is made of soft-touch silicone for comfortable and cool to touch grip. Its non-stick interior with specially formulated 5-coat system is virtually as hard as diamonds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vouyHGmzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Denmark","source_asin":"B006SS6PCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006SS6PCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006SS6PCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558258,"name":"CafePress Yellowstone National Park Mug Ceramic Coffee Mug, Tea Cup 11 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619hy5gRZbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Perfect for your mid-morning pick me up a the office or for your decaf before the gym. This 11 ounce cup is an easy go-to mug for everyday use. Each of our beautiful mugs are printed by professionals in the USA with Lead-Free design for your safety. Whether you're drinking coffee, tea, or hot chocolate, this mug is perfect for you and your family. Our premium quality mugs are constructed of heat resistant ceramic and are dishwasher safe (top rack) and microwave safe. Choose your favorite coffee mug for women and men. Choose a quote mug for your best friend, a religious mug for your family, or a funny mug for your coworker. Whatever your hobby or passion, we are bound to have a mug for that.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619hy5gRZbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B014JSTUP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014JSTUP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014JSTUP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
