window.products.push({"id":558261,"name":"Pink Damask Bridal Shower Luncheon Napkins, 16ct","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cZS308unL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Guests will love our sweet Pink Damask Bridal Shower Paper Lunch Napkins and you'll love the convenience of disposable party supplies. This large pack of 16 Pink Damask Paper Luncheon Napkins makes it convenient to serve your favorite appetizers and snacks, or wipe up any unexpected spills at your bridal shower. These Pink Damask Lunch Napkins feature \"Bridal Shower\" text. Disposable paper napkins make after party clean up fast and simple, ensuring you'll get to spend more time with family and friends at your wedding celebrations. Combine Pink Damask Paper Luncheon Napkins with other Pink Damask party tableware or coordinate with solid color wedding supplies and wedding decorations to personalize your reception or party table! Pink Damask Luncheon Napkins are sold in a package of 16 and measure 6.5\" x 6.5\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cZS308unL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unique","source_asin":"B00JPCNZHE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JPCNZHE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JPCNZHE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558262,"name":"Continental Art Center BD-0713 8 by 8-Inch Framed Red Chilipepper Ceramic Art Tile","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lOFc2tpOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All works are started with a sketch on paper, later filled with watercolors to see the effect. A specially made “Bubble Pen” was used to create the 3-D raising details, through which liquid form of ceramic is piped onto the unfired clay surface. The ridges that are created by the piping process become barriers between colors during the glazing steps as well as a great way to achieve a more defined image after the firing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lOFc2tpOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Continental Art Center","source_asin":"B009JCNQQ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009JCNQQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009JCNQQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558263,"name":"humble Innovations Bed Bridge Twin to King Converter Kit – Twin XL and Twin Bed Connector King Maker – 2 Unique Adjustable Straps - Memory Foam Slide ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915pTIYagML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you enjoy hosting guests, or you need some extra flexibility with your beds, conjoined beds are extremely practical, but pose the problem of the uncomfortable gap. This mattress bridge connector is the ultimate solution! With a user-friendly design and a compact storage bag, this bed connector will take your and your guests’ sleeping experience to a whole new level! Some of the amazing qualities of this product: - Includes: humble Innovations Bed Bridge, 2 bed securing belts, and compact carry bag; - Made with care using hypoallergenic 25D memory foam; - Quality tear resistant materials resist moisture and unpleasant odors; - Easy to maintain; - Ridged design of the insert provides non-slip qualities and makes it easier to roll up into the ultra-compact bag; - Easy to use, can be setup within minutes; - Belt fits to combine Twin, Twin XL, Full and Full XL bed sizes. A necessity for every home! Easy 3 step setup: 1. Join your two beds together and fully insert the bridge into the gap. 2. Wrap the belt tightly around both beds and place the belt through one of the openings on both ends of the bridge, choosing the best for your bed. 3. When combining Twin and Twin XL beds a King size sheet will fit great overtop. Enjoy the luxury! If cleaning is needed use a wet cloth to wipe the top. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We trust our product and thoughtful design, that’s why if for any reason you don’t love our mattress connecting system, we guarantee a hassle free return or replacement within 60 Days. Even beyond that we promise premier customer service, and will do our best to work with you and keep you happy! ADD TO CART NOW and reap all the benefits this bed connector set has to offer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915pTIYagML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"humble Innovations","source_asin":"B07KRWG5GW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRWG5GW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRWG5GW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558264,"name":"Golden State Art, 11x14 Diploma Frame for 8.5x11 Document & Certificates with Mat, Or 11x14 Without Mat, Real Glass, Double Mat (Black with Navy/Gold ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A9VVkW9FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESIGN: Simple style, Pre-assembled Photo Wood Frame with Frontal Real Glass and a Double Mat. Frame molding is 1-inch wide. Overall Frame Size: 12.5x15.5 inches. FIT PRINT SIZE: 2 pack, 11x14 (without Mat) or 8.5x11 (with Mat) PHOTO MAT DETAILS: Color is Navy over Gold. EXACT Double Mat Opening/inner size: 8 x 10.5 inches (This is Mat Opening Window size for 8.5x11 prints or photo). opening was designed slightly smaller than photo itself in order to hold it steadily while not a defect. FOR WALL DECOR: The Back has turning hardware clips and 2 sawtooth hangers made for portrait or landscape display. Give a classic traditional feel to any room with this beautiful design. SHOW YOUR SUCCESS: Perfect frame to place, secure, and display your achievements or certification awards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A9VVkW9FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Golden State Art","source_asin":"B09SGN3SDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SGN3SDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SGN3SDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
