window.products.push({"id":558365,"name":"CASABREWS Espresso Machine with Grinder, Professional Espresso Maker with Milk Frother Steam Wand, 20 Bar Barista Cappuccino Machine with LCD Display ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":599.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JUZb2f1bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Make Your Favorite Espresso Coffee at Home】: Our coffee machine with grinder and milk frother allows you to prepare all your favorite espresso coffee. You can now enjoy a barista-brewed latte, cappuccino, or macchiato at home. The stainless-steel appearance makes it stylish and durable. This versatile machine is not only perfect for home or office use, but also makes a great wedding gift, anniversary gift, Christmas gift, and gift for mom, dad, men, women, husband, and wife. ☕【LCD Display for Intuitive Interface】: LCD display with grinding and extracting progress animations. The screen provides you all the precise information you need to make coffee exactly the way you like it every time. It will also give corresponding prompts to ensure that the machine is running properly. Let you make the best cup of coffee easier. ☕【Professional 20-Bar Pressure System】: A semi-automatic, all-in-one espresso machine with a 20-bar professional Italian pump and a 1500W powerful motor. This latte machine gives you the top-quality extraction, resulting in a more fragrant and richer aroma in your coffee. The built-in pressure gauge on this cappuccino machine shows the exact pressure, which helps you make adjustments according to your personal taste preferences. You can easily create a cup of cappuccino, latte or flat white in your home or office with our cappuccino maker. ☕【Built-In Grinder】: This espresso coffee maker has an automatic built-in precision conical burr grinder, which grinds on demand and deposits fresh ground coffee into the portafilter. With 15 adjustable grind settings, you can have total control over the grind level, ensuring that you will get the best flavor from your coffee beans. Our espresso machine with grinder allows you to go from beans to espresso in just a few minutes. Note: For best performance, clean the grinder every 18-25 days to remove buildups. ☕【Milk Foaming System】: The barista-quality microfoam enhances the flavor of the coffee and is essential for creating latte arts at home. Our coffee espresso machine has a powerful milk foaming steam wand, so that you can generate creamy and rich milk microfoam to create amazing milk foam arts and enhance the flavor of your brews. Awaken your inner barista artist and create your own unique milk foam arts. Don't pass by us if you are looking for an excellent espresso machine with milk frother. ☕【Stylish & User-Friendly Design】: With a simple & clear dial interface for selecting steam, hot water, and pre-programmed single & double shots, this 20-bar espresso coffee machine with grinder is super easy to use. The 92 oz transparent water tank is detachable and easy to fill. The beautiful brushed stainless-steel design makes this latte maker suitable for kitchen of any sizes. We also provide a one-year warranty. If there is anything that we can assist you with, please don't hesitate to contact us. ☕【Using Tips】: Too coarse a grind, too little coffee, or insufficiently tamping the grounds before brewing can all lead to inadequate pressure for a proper brew. It is very important to use fresh coffee beans. If the coffee beans are left in the coffee bean container and exposed to the air for long time, it will cause the oils in the coffee beans to evaporate, resulting in a low pressure. Note: You can watch more INSTRUCTIONAL VIDEO by clicking Visit the CASABREWS Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JUZb2f1bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASABREWS","source_asin":"B0C2898515","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2898515","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2898515","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
