window.products.push({"id":558487,"name":"Ritz Royale Collection Cotton Terry Pocket Mitt Pot Holder Set, Ocean, 2-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1una1ePN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Established in 1892, the John Ritzenthaler company (Ritz) has long been synonymous with the finest quality in home textiles. This Ritz Royale 2-piece basic pocket mitt in ocean, is a great value set for your kitchen. Made from 100-percent terry looped cotton, the hand pocket provides great heat protection. Each Ritz pocket mitt measures 8.5-inch long by 7.75-inch wide. These Ritz pocket mitts coordinate with the Ritz Royale collection, comprised of aprons, kitchen towels, dishcloths, checked kitchen towels, wonder towels, pot holders, Ritz Mitz, pocket mitts and cotton/neoprene oven mitts. Machine wash in cold water and tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1una1ePN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritz","source_asin":"B0067HFQQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0067HFQQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0067HFQQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558488,"name":"Celtic And Saint Michael and Miraculous Medals Holy Land Handmade Wall Wood Cross Crucifix - 10 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MHQM0t7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Saint Michael with Celtic Cross combines the power of the Celtic Cross with the power of the Saint Michael Medal all with the most venerated and powerful Miraculous medal of our Lady. The Miraculous Medal (French: MÚdaille miraculeuse), also known as the Medal of the Immaculate Conception, is a medal, the design of which was originated by Saint Catherine LabourÚ following her vision of the Blessed Virgin Mary and made by goldsmith Adrien Vachette. On November 27, 1830, Catherine reported that the Blessed Mother returned during evening meditations. She displayed herself inside an oval frame, standing upon a globe, wearing many rings of different colors, most of which shone rays of light over the globe. Around the margin of the frame appeared the words (\"O Mary, conceived without sin, pray for us who have recourse to thee\"). It is a very powerful Cross. The ring of the Celtic Cross represents eternity. The Cross symbolizes salvation through Lord Jesus Christ dying for our sins. The Saint Michael protective Medal reminds us of the Angels protection for us and of God's protection through St. Michael defender of Faith and the Church of Christ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MHQM0t7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holy Land Market","source_asin":"B06XV44775","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XV44775","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XV44775","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
