window.products.push({"id":558550,"name":"Umbra 242732-797-REM Twilight Single Curtain Rod Set – Wrap Around Design is Ideal for Blackout or Room Darkening Panels, 28-48, Bronze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tqlWgaiDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Windows are an essential part of your home and offer a unique opportunity to dramatically improve the aesthetics of each room simply by adding attractive curtains or drapes. But sometimes, finding the right curtain rods can be a challenge, especially when you’re looking for the perfect combination of style and functionality. Introducing the Twilight Curtain Rod by Umbra With a simple yet modern design, the Twilight curtain rod is the perfect way to complement your curtains or drapes without drawing attention away from them. The sleek look and finish of Twilight is a decorator’s dream because it works with a wide variety of decorative styles and color palettes. Perfect Black Out Curtains For Bedroom If you’re looking to block out as much light as possible with a black out window curtain then you’re going to love the Twilight curtain rod. It’s innovative wrap-around design helps prevent light leakage by allowing your curtain panel to rest flush against the wall. Durable, High-Quality Curtain Rod When it comes to curtain rods, quality construction counts and Twilight doesn’t disappoint. Unlike cheaply made rods that tend to bend or warp over time, each Twilight curtain rod from Umbra is made of high-quality metal and individually checked for quality assurance. The result is a front drapery rod with a 3/4 inch diameter that is sturdy and designed to support a variety of window fashions, including light to medium weight curtains with a max weight of 22lbs. Telescoping Rod Finding a curtain rod to fit your window can be challenging, so we made the Twilight curtain rod available in 3 sizes: 28-48-inches, 48-88-inches, and 88-144-inches. Thanks to its telescoping capabilities, each Twilight rod will fit a variety of window sizes and is ideal for room darkening curtains for bedroom. About Umbra: A global product design company providing original, modern, casual, and functional design for the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tqlWgaiDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Umbra","source_asin":"B0C6YHXWFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6YHXWFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6YHXWFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
