window.products.push({"id":558865,"name":"Gourmesso 2 in 1 Descaling Solution and Cleaning Pod Kit Compatible with Nespresso ORIGINAL Machines - Use for Fresher, Cleaner, & Better Tasting Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717P9mB60cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE, CLEAN, FRESH COFFEE! Gourmesso Descaling & Cleaning kit is the best 2 in 1 solution to keep the brew chamber, nozzle and exit spout of your machine free of existing residue and remove the mineral and limescale that builds up in your machine over time. Your Nespresso Original machine will feel like new after using our easy to use cleaning kit! Safe, Eco-Friendly & Compatible with Nespresso Original Machines: Biodegradable, phosphate-free and odorless made for use only in Nespresso Original Machines, will NOT work in any Nespresso Virtuoline machines. Simple Descaling Instructions: Completely empty the descaling bottle into the water reservoir then add enough water to fill the remainder of the reservoir. Brew your machine until the water reservoir is empty and refill the reservoir with water. Brew your machine until the water reservoir is empty and repeat. Simple Cleaning Instructions: Load the cleaning capsule into your Nespresso Original Machine and brew the largest cup size twice. Remove the cleaning capsule from your machine and brew the machine with no capsule twice. It’s that simple! SATISFACTION GUARANTEE – We promise to go above and beyond to make you completely happy with your 2 in 1 Descaling & Cleaning Kit. Contact us any time with any feedback or questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717P9mB60cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmesso","source_asin":"B09HHKBJ4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HHKBJ4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HHKBJ4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558866,"name":"Anolon Brunello 9-Inch Bread Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21TRJEWXGEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A serrated blade for neat, even slicing through soft, fresh loaves. Also great for foods such as tomatoes that have hard exteriors and a soft interior. Protective sheath included for safe storage. Amazon.com Branching out from its already successful cookware line, Anolons Brunello collection features high-grade materials with substantial weight. This 9-inch, serrated bread knife cuts focaccia into neat squares or crusty French bread into even slices without tearing, and is also good for slicing tomatoes without squishing them. The Brunello Collection knives feature blades forged from high-quality German carbon steel that resists rust and food stains. The stainless steel is ice-hardened for additional strength and longer edge retention. Blades are then polished with glass to produce an edge that is meant to be simultaneously sharp but smoother to the touch. Full tangs and a counter balance cap provide superior balance, while a rounded blade spine adds more comfort during extended periods of prepping. Beautiful handcrafted wood handles show off a rich grain in variegated shades of light and dark. Their ergonomic shape offers a safe, comfortable grip. This bread knife comes with a plastic sheath to protect the blade during in-drawer storage. Anolon guarantees this cutlery under a lifetime limited warranty and, for proper maintenance, recommends hand washing and immediately drying knives. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21TRJEWXGEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B0006B3VRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006B3VRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006B3VRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
