window.products.push({"id":558927,"name":"Masterplay 3-Piece Fine Printed Oversize (100\" X 95\") Quilt Set, Bedspread Coverlet Queen Size Bed Cover (Shades of Purple, Stripe)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816tBOSbEAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber is an all-season fabric with its ability to hold color well. Stain Resistant-People with children and those looking for sturdy material for a bedroom, children's room or RV may especially like microfiber fabric for its durability and stain resistance. The material is so tightly woven — with fibers thinner than a human hair that it naturally repels water and stains. Even highly staining substances like coffee can usually be wiped away without a trace if they are caught right away. Get a classy and comfortable finish every time you make up your room. This soft fabric resist wrinkling and fading and item comes in various colors and textures to suit your needs and decorate your homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816tBOSbEAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Masterplay","source_asin":"B086B6WH6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086B6WH6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086B6WH6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":558928,"name":"GROSCHE Chicago Steel Infuser Bottle, tea infuser flask, infuser water bottle thermos, Insulated Stainless Steel flask with tea infuser (Black, 22 fl ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KJMF4ZQvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ [ 5 in 1 Multifunction insulated water bottle ] The Chicago Steel is a 22 fl oz insulated water bottle infuser that can do so many things. You can use it as a insulated coffee mug , as a tea diffuser for loose tea with the included tea infuser for loose tea, iced tea, or as a infusion water bottle for fruit infused water, as a cold brew or iced coffee tumbler or just as a great travel mug ⭐ [ 18.8 insulated double walled stainless steel water bottle ] This thermal flask is vacuum insulated to keep your tea or coffee hot (upto 12 hrs) or your iced coffee or infused water cold (upto 24 hrs). It makes a great travel mug as it fits standard cup holders. Its a great travel coffee tumbler as it holds 22 oz (Venti size) and keeps your coffee or tea hot when you're on the go. ⭐ [ Ideal travel mug and tea mug with infuser ] If you are a lover of loose leaf tea and would like a travel tea infuser mug for loose lea then this is the ideal flask for you. The included two part stainless steel tea infuser can be used to steep loose leaf tea, tea bags, or even as a fruit infuser water bottle . The infuser is large to give your loose leaf tea leaves ample space to expand as they steep to give you a great tea infusion. The insulated thermos will keep your tea hot. ⭐ [ Infuser water bottle for home or office ] The included stainless steel infuser is ideal to make fruit infused water. Just add your fruit in the flask, add water, and add in the strainer then close the lid. The fruit will infuse in your insulated water bottle, and the strainer will filter it as you drink. Just add more water or ice to the fruit and you can enjoy it all day at home, at work, or on the go. ⭐ [ You Give Back every time you choose GROSCHE ] Whenever you purchase a GROSCHE Product you give back with 50+ days of safe water for someone in need. Every Chicago tea infuser flask carries the 50+ logo to signify that you have given safe water to those in need via the GROSCHE Safe Water Project. GROSCHE is a social enterprise built to help those affected by the safe water crisis and raises funds for its work through the sales of their products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KJMF4ZQvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GROSCHE","source_asin":"B09JV75T9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JV75T9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JV75T9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
