window.products.push({"id":558998,"name":"Vaulia Lightweight Microfiber Duvet Cover Set, Colorful Floral Print Pattern, Pink - Queen Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W-C9+LlpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enjoy these benefits when you use Vaulia Duvet Cover Sets Convenience Duvet Cover is designed as a removable cover ( features a hidden button or zipper closure ) for your comforter( sometimes referred to as a Duvet ), analogous to a pillow case and pillow. You can use your comforter without a top bed sheet ( flat sheet), as the duvet cover can readily be removed and washable as often as the bottom sheet, then you don’t need to clean your comforter, which can be experience and difficult to clean. Comfort Duvet Cover come in various blends of materials and weaves, it doesn’t matter if you prefer cotton or polyester microfiber, you are likely to find a duvet cover in a fabric that will feel great to you. Stylish One of the easily and most comfortable ways to quickly update the style of your bedroom is to change the bedding. With duvet covers, you can change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate. Duvet Covers from Vaulia aren’t just made from a wide range of different materials, they’re made from all kinds of style. Vaulia most popular duvet features well designed print patterns, you are sure to find a duvet cover to fit your style and taste. Package Includes 1x Duvet cover (Comforter sold separately, not in sets) 2x Pillow shams (ONLY 1 piece for Twin-size option) Note, Actual color may vary from the color on your screen due to monitor color restrictions. Size Information Twin-size Duvet cover: 69 by 90 inches Pillow Sham: 20 by 26 inches Full/Queen size Duvet cover: 90 by 90 inches Pillow sham: 20 by 26 inches King size Duvet cover: 104 by 90 inches Pillow sham: 20 by 36 inches Care Instruction Machine wash with cold water; Do not bleach; Tumble dry, low heat; Iron, Medium; Do not dry-clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W-C9+LlpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vaulia","source_asin":"B01GOPJFIM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-558998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GOPJFIM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GOPJFIM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
